<title>USA: National Energy says Icahn to invest$10 mln.</title>
<headline>National Energy says Icahn to invest$10 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Energy Group Inc said Tuesday Icahn Associates Corp agreed to invest, through a related partnership, in its oil and gas exploration prospects.</p>
<p>National Energy said the agreement provides that Icahn will participate in its exploration program in an aggregate amount of $10 million.</p>
</text>
